WEBVTT

00:02:28.756 --> 00:02:33.036
they’re arguing about
how their lives should be in London

00:02:33.036 --> 00:02:35.076
and who their son Thomas should be.

00:02:35.876 --> 00:02:39.076
Should he be open to change,

00:02:39.076 --> 00:02:41.636
or should he be cautious
in the face of risk?

00:02:43.476 --> 00:02:44.716
I want to argue

00:02:44.716 --> 00:02:50.636
that the digital has become the terrain
on which we are negotiating who we are:

00:02:50.676 --> 00:02:51.956
our identities,

00:02:51.956 --> 00:02:53.836
our relationships,

00:02:53.836 --> 00:02:55.116
our values

00:02:55.116 --> 00:02:57.276
and our children’s life chances.

00:02:57.676 --> 00:03:03.276
No wonder our anxieties and arguments
about technology are often so fraught.